{
  "title": "AECi Phase 2 — Traffic",
  "description": "Phase 2 traffic observability (AECI-66). Custom metrics emitted by the SSR Worker (aeci-web) and API Worker (aeci-api): aeci.page.render.duration_ms, aeci.api.query.duration_ms, aeci.cache.purge. NOTE (WC-8 / AECI-322): under native Workers Cache a HIT skips the SSR Worker, so cache_status is MISS / non_cacheable only — there is no cache_status:hit series. Edge HIT-rate lives on the Cloudflare Workers observability dashboard (Cf-Cache-Status), not here; the render metrics below are MISS / Worker-run volume. Distribution metrics require percentile aggregations enabled under Metrics > Summary. Committed for record (AECI-66); the live dashboard is the source of truth — re-export after edits.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "reflow_type": "auto",
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": ["staging", "production"],
      "default": "production"
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Top routes by request count (SSR route_class)",
        "type": "toplist",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "q",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.page.render.duration_ms{$env} by {route_class}",
                "aggregator": "sum"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "q", "limit": { "count": 10, "order": "desc" } }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "**Edge cache HIT-rate → Cloudflare Workers observability.** Under native Workers Cache (WC-3 / WC-8 · AECI-322) a HIT is served from the edge **without running the SSR Worker**, so `cache_status:hit` is never emitted to Datadog. The render widgets on this dashboard are **MISS / Worker-run volume only** (`cache_status:MISS`/`miss`/`non_cacheable`). Read HIT-rate from **`Cf-Cache-Status`** on the Cloudflare Workers observability dashboard: Workers & Pages → `aeci-web` → Observability. The old `cache_status:hit` widget + the `cache hit rate < 70%` monitor were **retired** in WC-8 (they would flatline at 0 / alert forever). See `docs/OBSERVABILITY.md` and `docs/CACHE_STRATEGY.md` §7.1.",
        "background_color": "yellow",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false,
        "tick_pos": "50%",
        "tick_edge": "left",
        "has_padding": true
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Page render duration per route_class — p50 / p95 / p99",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "p50",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "p50:aeci.page.render.duration_ms{$env} by {route_class}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "p50", "alias": "p50" }]
          },
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "p95",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "p95:aeci.page.render.duration_ms{$env} by {route_class}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "p95", "alias": "p95" }]
          },
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "p99",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "p99:aeci.page.render.duration_ms{$env} by {route_class}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "p99", "alias": "p99" }]
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": { "label": "ms" }
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "p95 API query duration per endpoint",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "p95",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "p95:aeci.api.query.duration_ms{$env} by {endpoint}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "p95" }]
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": { "label": "ms" }
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "4xx / 5xx error rate over time (both Workers)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "line",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "r4",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.page.render.duration_ms{$env,status_class:4xx}"
              },
              {
                "name": "r5",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.page.render.duration_ms{$env,status_class:5xx}"
              },
              {
                "name": "rt",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.page.render.duration_ms{$env}"
              },
              {
                "name": "a4",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.api.query.duration_ms{$env,status_class:4xx}"
              },
              {
                "name": "a5",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.api.query.duration_ms{$env,status_class:5xx}"
              },
              {
                "name": "at",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.api.query.duration_ms{$env}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              { "formula": "(r4 + a4) / (rt + at) * 100", "alias": "4xx rate %" },
              { "formula": "(r5 + a5) / (rt + at) * 100", "alias": "5xx rate %" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": { "label": "%", "min": "0" },
        "markers": [
          { "value": "y = 1", "display_type": "error dashed", "label": "1% alert threshold" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Cache purge events by source",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "display_type": "bars",
            "queries": [
              {
                "name": "purges",
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "query": "count:aeci.cache.purge{$env} by {source}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [{ "formula": "purges" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
